direction: down
start: Start here\nResolve sources and destination {
  style: {fill: "#19354D"; font-color: white; bold: true}
}
valid: Inputs and destination valid? {shape: diamond}
temp: Write unique private temporary PDF\nIn destination directory
check: Reopen and validate\nFlush and fsync complete file
publish: Atomic no-clobber publication\nHard link to destination
success: Complete prepared PDF\nRemove temporary name
failure: Report actionable error\nNo new destination before commit
start -> valid: 1. Check selections and aliases
valid -> temp: 2. Yes and not dry-run
valid -> failure: No
temp -> check: 3. Copy succeeds
temp -> failure: Write error or cancellation
check -> publish: 4. Validation succeeds
check -> failure: Validation error or cancellation
publish -> success: 5. Link succeeds = commit point
publish -> failure: Destination exists or link fails
